        "notes": "Round One\n\nALWAYS pick [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) first.\n\nTips:\n- Swap your beam target every ~3 seconds for constant uptime\n- TOF connects through walls with no range limitation, this can be used to heal/dmg boost targets that you usually wouldn't be able to due to survival risks, so take advantage of beaming around corners/walls\n- Your previous target gets a less effective beam, keep that in mind when healing critical targets/boosting abilities or ultimates\n- Because TOF has no range limits and your beam will connect to two targets, you may accidentally expose a teammate taking an off-angle. Take note of your teammate's positioning.",
