        "notes": "Round Two\n\nThe most important thing to grab here is [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) and [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f).  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is great for it's 15% weapon power but it's expensive. You can add 5% and 10% weapon power with the two previously mentioned abilities for $500 less AND gain some cooldown reduction and attack speed along with it. \n\nSometimes round one goes really badly and you won't be able to afford both of these abilties. In that case, grab [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and/or [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) \n\nIf you can afford it, you can swap Icy Coolant for Talon Modification Module.",
