        "notes": "Round Four\n\nIf you didn't grab it last round, grab  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) here. Like I said last round, I usually do not have trouble with survivability so sell  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6). \n\nI sell weapon grease to afford all my rare WP abilities, grab these if you haven't yet.\n\nIf you are really struggling and getting focused by hitscan, adjust your positioning and use your environment to stay alive. You can grab  [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) instead of Amari's Antidote for some survival and WP, but I would recommend  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) instead.\n\nFrom this round on, I only pick [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) depending on the map. The best map for this is Gogadoro. It is almost always better to invest in WP to prevent deaths.",
