        "notes": "Round Five\n\nRecently I've been going for [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) in round five, though it depends how your team is doing. I only pick  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) if I've had opportunities to rez. Like I said before, if you are focusing on a WP build, your team should stay alive so you may not even have opportunities to rez. If you are running Renaissance, pick [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f). The other power option is [Battle Medic](item_ccd0edff-4d57-4ac2-83a7-bab6ff0ffb2f) and this is ONLY if you feel strongly that you will win without a problem. It's mostly for fun at this point. If things are iffy, stick with distortion and other abilities that will prioritize keeping your team up. \n\nI finally sell  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and pick up  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448). If you can afford it, sell  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) for [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121).\n\nTips:\n- Protective Beam is automatic so there isn't much to change about your playstyle.",
