        "notes": "Round Seven\n\nAt this point, none of the powers are really helpful unless we switch up our entire build to accommodate them, so we are just going for  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) to hopefully take advantage of  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) more often.\n\nYour team might be losing one or two people more often than earlier rounds, so it makes the most sense to grab  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) this round.\n\nThe goal of this final build is to keep up your team for as long as possible with high WP, and if one or two die, you have booster jets, resurrection rangefinder, and renaissance to bring them back safely. Just play smart- you are by no means invincible with this build. If someone dies in a risky spot, don't run into the same risk to bring them back. This build also gives you some cooldown reduction, so it is possible to stay in perma-flight. BUT again, play it safe. This is ideal againt Reinhardt, Junkrat, Genji, Reaper. Don't be using that perma-flight if they are running hitscan.",
